Assignment: Question 5 - Kericho Tea Factory Pipeline


## Project Overview
This project demonstrates the use of Lua coroutines to simulate a tea factory’s production pipeline.  
Each batch passes through the following stages:
- Receiving
- Weighing
- Withering
- Drying (with quality check)
- Grading
- Packaging

If a batch fails quality inspection after drying, it is reprocessed.

## Features Implemented
- Coroutine design for individual tea batches
- Yielding batch ID and stage after each operation
- Quality check with reprocessing logic
- Scheduler for interleaving multiple batches
- Explanation of coroutine state persistent

